# Kubernetes Troubleshooting Advanced

## Node Issues
```bash
kubectl describe node <node-name> | grep -A 5 "Conditions:"
kubectl top node <node-name>
kubectl top pods -A --sort-by=memory
kubectl drain <node-name> --ignore-daemonsets
