Next.js: https://nextjs.org/llms.txt
Remix: https://remix.run/llms.txt
SvelteKit: https://kit.svelte.dev/llms.txt
```

## Topic Keyword Normalization

**Rules:**
- Lowercase
- Remove special chars
- Use first word for multi-word topics
