    -> Extract JWT from request header
    -> Extract user from SecurityContext
    -> BlacklistedTokenService.blacklistToken(jwt, expiryDate)
    -> RefreshTokenService.deleteByUserId(userId)
    -> Return 200 "Logged out successfully"
