# Phase 2: Account Lock Service

## Context Links

- [UserService.java](/src/main/java/com/namnd/springjwt/service/UserService.java)
- [UserServiceImpl.java](/src/main/java/com/namnd/springjwt/service/impl/UserServiceImpl.java)
