| 1 | Project Scaffolding | Pending | 2h | [phase-01](./phase-01-project-scaffolding-maven-docker-gateway.md) |
| 2 | Movie Service | Pending | 4h | [phase-02](./phase-02-movie-service-entities-and-api.md) |
