2. **Add Kafka config to auth-service application.yml:**
   ```yaml
   spring:
     kafka:
       bootstrap-servers: ${KAFKA_HOST:localhost}:9092
       producer:
         key-serializer: org.apache.kafka.common.serialization.StringSerializer
