# Phase 3: Comments Section with Pagination

## Context Links
- [Plan Overview](./plan.md)
- [Phase 1 — Services & Models](./phase-01-services-and-models.md)
- [Phase 2 — Star Rating](./phase-02-star-rating-component.md)
