## Configuration Standards

**application.yml Structure**
```yaml
# ✓ Good: Organized by concern
server:
  port: 8080

spring:
  jpa:
    hibernate:
      ddl-auto: none
    show-sql: true
  datasource:
    url: jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/testdb
